        "{\"a2uiMeta\":{\"note\":\"Blackjack at a 1,000-chip bankroll. The table is set for betting; choose your stake and deal when ready.\",\"trace\":{\"turnIndex\":0,\"query\":{\"intent\":\"## Referenced for this message\\n### blackjack (resource)\\nblackjack, 21, hit, stand, double, split: the classic house game\\n\\nTwo cards each; dealer shows one, hole card face-down. Values: pips as printed, faces 10, Ace 1 or 11. A natural (Ace + ten-card on the deal) ends the round at once: reveal the hole card, settle it (3:2 unless the dealer also has 21, then a push), and offer no hit, stand or double. Otherwise the player acts first: hit, stand, double (one card, doubled stake), split pairs; over 21 busts immediately. Dealer then reveals and draws to 17, standing on all 17s. Blackjack (Ace + ten-card) pays 3:2, a win pays 1:1, equal totals push.\\n\\nBlackjack, please.\",\"k\":3},\"exemplarIds\":[\"domain-croupier-card-table-round\",\"frontier-round-outcome\",\"frontier-result-card-win\"],\"rounds\":3,\"healed\":0,\"failureCodes\":[\"PARSE\",\"TEXT_JSONL_IGNORED\",\"SURFACE_DEGRADED\"],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"prompt\":{\"limit\":142000,\"total\":56987,\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"grammar\",\"chars\":25605},{\"id\":\"components\",\"chars\":20517},{\"id\":\"functions\",\"chars\":145},{\"id\":\"few-shot\",\"chars\":3515},{\"id\":\"mini-skills\",\"chars\":2351},{\"id\":\"persona\",\"chars\":4854}],\"over\":false},\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":14500,\"outputTokens\":4339,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":52521,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0},\"miniSkillIds\":[\"card-layout\",\"game-table-chrome\",\"game-hud\"],\"cacheBoundary\":46267}}}"
